    "Your whole team is tired out…":"Seluruh timmu kelelahan…",
    "You hurry back to rest and drop 🪙 {n} on the way.":"Kamu bergegas kembali untuk beristirahat dan menjatuhkan 🪙 {n} di jalan.",
    "Your Wordlings feel better after a long rest. 🍃":"Wordling-mu merasa lebih baik setelah istirahat panjang. 🍃",
    "A wild {p} appeared!":"{p} liar muncul!",
    "{p} wants to battle!":"{p} ingin bertarung!",
    "The block ball glows bright! ✨":"Bola balok bersinar terang! ✨",
